{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/routing/route-load-errors","title":"Route load errors","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"route-load-errors","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Route load errors"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is the failure mode nothing else covers: the route is valid, the guards"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"passed, and the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"JavaScript chunk itself"}]},{"t":"text","text":" never arrives — a stale hash after a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"deploy, a flaky network, an offline user."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" your app is lazy-loaded and deployed more than once. Which is to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"say: use it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"withRouteLoadError(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" handles failures that happen before Craft can mount the target route:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"lazy "},{"t":"code","text":"loadComponent"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" chunks that fail to load, rejected dynamic imports, stale"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"deployments, CDN errors, or offline transitions."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is different from "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/exceptions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"handleExceptions"}]},{"t":"text","text":": route exceptions are business"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exceptions raised by guards, resolvers, or route code. Route load errors happen while Craft is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"trying to fetch the JavaScript needed to activate the route."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"register-the-route-load-error-screen","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Register the route-load error screen"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass "},{"t":"code","text":"withRouteLoadError(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" to "},{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftRouter(...)"},{"t":"text","text":", next to the router features and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"other craft loading features:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideCraftRouter,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  withRouteLoadError,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  withErrorComponent,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideCraftRouter","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  appRoutes.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toRoutes","kind":"function"},{"text":"(),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"withErrorComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    component: MyGlobalErrorScreen,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    componentDeps:","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      {} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'./my-global-error-screen'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":").","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"GenDeps_MyGlobalErrorScreen","kind":"type"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"withRouteLoadError","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    component: MyRouteLoadErrorScreen,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    componentDeps:","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      {} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'./my-route-load-error-screen'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":").","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"GenDeps_MyRouteLoadErrorScreen","kind":"type"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    retry: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      attempts: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      delayMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"250","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The component must be eager. Do not configure the route-load error screen with "},{"t":"code","text":"loadComponent"},{"t":"text","text":": the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failure case is precisely that lazy JavaScript may be unavailable."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"runtime-behaviour","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Runtime behaviour"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When a lazy route load fails, Craft:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"runs the configured retry strategy;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"converts the final failure to a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftException"},{"t":"text","text":" with code "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_ROUTE_LOAD_ERROR"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"renders the configured route-load error component;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"keeps the browser URL on the original target URL."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The last point matters. Internally, Craft activates a technical recovery route so there is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"something safe to render, but "},{"t":"code","text":"browserUrl"},{"t":"text","text":" keeps the visible URL as the intended route:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"/mutation/123"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"→ lazy chunk fails"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"→ retry fails"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"→ route-load error screen is shown"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"→ browser URL stays /mutation/123"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"→ F5 reloads /mutation/123 and retries the real route"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"callout","tone":"info","caption":"No dedicated loading UI during JavaScript fetches yet","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"While Craft is fetching a lazy "},{"t":"code","text":"loadComponent"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" chunk, including time spent in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"configured retry strategy, Craft does not currently display the route's "},{"t":"code","text":"pendingComponent"},{"t":"text","text":" or another"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dedicated loading component. The pending component starts only after the JavaScript has loaded and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"route has been activated, while the Craft "},{"t":"code","text":"canMatch"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"canActivate"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"resolve"},{"t":"text","text":" chain is running."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Extending the pending timeline to cover slow chunk downloads and retries is planned as a future"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"evolution. Until then, the previous route may remain visible while the JavaScript request is pending;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the route-load error component appears only after all configured retries fail."}]}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Browser-cached module failures","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Browsers can remember a failed dynamic "},{"t":"code","text":"import()"},{"t":"text","text":" for the exact same module specifier. Wrap each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft lazy route import with the loader's "},{"t":"code","text":"withRetry"},{"t":"text","text":" helper:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"loadComponent"},{"text":": ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"withRetry"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"withRetry","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'./detail'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":")),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"loadChildren"},{"text":": ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"withRetry"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"withRetry","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'./admin.routes'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":")).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"then","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"m"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" m.adminRoutes),","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The initial import remains statically analyzable, so Craft and Vite still rewrite it to the hashed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"production chunk. On a configured retry, Craft extracts the emitted chunk URL from the browser"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"error and adds "},{"t":"code","text":"__craft_route_retry"},{"t":"text","text":" only to the failed request. A successful retry module is kept"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for the lifetime of the application and reused by later route activations."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This recovery depends on the browser including the failed module URL in the dynamic-import error."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"When it does not, "},{"t":"code","text":"reload()"},{"t":"text","text":" remains the reliable recovery path. Do not write"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"import(withRetryPrefix('./detail'))"},{"t":"text","text":": a runtime import specifier prevents the production chunk from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"being statically discovered."}]}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"build-the-error-component","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Build the error component"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The component can inject both the active technical exception and the recovery API:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { button, craftComponent, div, h2, p } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  CraftRouteLoadError,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  CraftRouteLoadRecovery,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideHostName,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// A sheet beside the screen: its frame, and the row of actions.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { loadError } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'./route-load-error.style'","ki